    <DataNode elementId="AT3G14790-MONOMER" textLabel="UDP-L-rhamnose synthase" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9LH76" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="615" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The |FRAME: TAX-3702 &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt;| genome contains three similar genes that were named |FRAME: AT1G78570 RHM1|, |FRAME: AT1G53500 RHM2| and |FRAME: AT3G14790 RHM3|. All three genes encode trifunctional proteins that catalyze the three reactions that are required to convert |FRAME: CPD-12575 UDP-&amp;alpha;-D-glucose| to |FRAME: UDP-L-RHAMNOSE UDP-&amp;beta;-L-rhamnose|: UDP-D-glucose 4,6-dehydratase; UDP-4-dehydro-6-deoxy-D-glucose 3,5-epimerase; and UDP-4-dehydro-L-rhamnose 4-reductase. Functional domain analysis showed that the N-terminal region of these proteins is responsible for the first activity, while the C-terminal region carries out the two following activities. Mutations in |FRAME: AT1G53500 RHM2| resulted in mucilage defects in seeds, due to defficiency of rhamnogalactan. All three genes were expressed in protease-deficient |FRAME: TAX-4932 &lt;i&gt;Saccharomyces cerevisiae&lt;/i&gt;| yeast cells, and assays performed with the cytoplasmic fraction of the recombinant yeast cells have shown that all three enzymes are trifunctional and catalyze all three functions |CITS: [17190829]|. |FRAME:TAX-3701 &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis&lt;/i&gt;| plants deficient in |FRAME: AT1G53500 RHM2| contain only 35 to 45% of the wild type-content of rhamnose in their seed mucilage |CITS:[14671019]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT3G14790-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT3G14790.2" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pride" value="Q9LH76" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Smr" value="Q9LH76" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pfam" value="PF16363" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Interpro" value="IPR036291" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="Q9LH76" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="AT3G14790.2" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-25417, RXN-25419, RXN-25418, RXN-10632" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="4" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT3G14790.2" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT3G14790" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="MONOMER-*" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_17190829" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_14671019" />
    </DataNode>
