    </DataNode>
    <DataNode elementId="AT1G78570-MONOMER" textLabel="AT1G78570-MONOMER" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9SYM5" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="450" centerY="695" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The dehydratase domain of the &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana RHM1&lt;/i&gt; gene was expressed in &lt;i&gt;E. coli&lt;/i&gt; and shown to catalyze the conversion of |FRAME: CPD-12575| into |FRAME:CPD-663| |CITS:[16766693]|. Although attempts were made at expressing the full length protein into &lt;i&gt;E. coli&lt;/i&gt;, those failed. The RHM1 protein, along with its paralogs |FRAME:AT1G53500| and RHM3, have been postulated to be trifunctional protein catalyzing the reaction |FRAME:RXN-5482| |CITS:[11554483]|; this remains speculative and has never been proven &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;in vivo&lt;/i&gt;. It is however said in the literature that RHM1 was shown to convert UDP-L-rhamnose (Link, B. and Reiter, W.-D., unpublished results in |CITS:[16766693]|). Mutant studies of RHM1 and its paralog however demonstrate that rhamnose biosynthesis is affected in those mutants |CITS:[14671019],[16766693]|. RHM1 belongs to a subclass of the NAD(P)-dependent short-chain dehydrogenase/reductase family of enzymes.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT1G78570-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT1G78570.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Smr" value="Q9SYM5" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pride" value="Q9SYM5" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Interpro" value="IPR036291" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pfam" value="PF16363" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Phylomedb" value="Q9SYM5" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Panther" value="PTHR10366:SF41" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pid" value="NP_177978" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="Q9SYM5" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-25412, RXN-25413, RXN-13058" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="3" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT1G78570.1" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT1G78570" />
